WEBVTT

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.770
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:19.020
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.480
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.900
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:30.190
On the way to Pavel's home, Frey collapses.

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:34.690
Kasel attempts to leave
on his own to protect Frey,

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:38.150
but is persuaded against that idea
by Roi and Cleo.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:45.190
Through this incident, the party recognized
how inseparable they had become.

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:48.100
Please promise me that you won't
push yourself excessively.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:55.060
Hello! Master Pavel?

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:04.940
What is this?!

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.190
Kasel!

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:07.230
Dammit!

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.100
What is this...?

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:18.100
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:23.310
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:33.650
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:38.150
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:42.690
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:47.940
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:52.600
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.940
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.810
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:02.440
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:04.940
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:08.900
<i>I search for you</i>

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:12.310
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:17.190
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:19.850
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:22.060
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:24.480
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:26.940
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:30.150
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:34.020
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:47.930
<i></i>The Solitary

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:47.930
<i></i>Sorcerer

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.230
Are you Master Pavel?

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.810
My name is Kasel.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:02.810
I've come here to ask you
to unseal the Holy Sword.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:11.580
Kasel!

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.150
Dammit! What's going on?!

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:16.600
Stand back!

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.980
No...

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:25.730
Seriously...?

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.350
You are Master Pavel, right?!

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:37.230
Please, listen to me!

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:08.690
Not even that one? In that case!

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.730
Go!

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:34.020
I knew I could do it.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.150
Kasel!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.600
You pass.

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.810
Hey, is he...?!

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.190
What's going on?

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:48.810
I don't know...

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:51.480
What did he mean by "pass"?

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:54.060
Um, you are Master Pavel, right?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.560
Yes.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:59.190
Were you testing my power?

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:04.230
And by "pass," do you mean
I passed the test? But I...

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.520
Not you.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:10.310
I was testing your friends.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.600
Huh? Us?

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:17.150
The bearer of the Holy Sword
must not be the only person with power.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.270
Only with the support of his powerful allies

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:24.400
can the bearer unleash his true strength.

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:27.650
Only then can he fight the Dark Lord.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:29.230
That makes sense...

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:35.100
Without everyone's help,
I wouldn't have been able to make it this far.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.810
We passed the test! Yay!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:39.980
Cleo...

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.810
I was waiting for you to come.

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:48.150
I wanted to talk to you about
what happened with Arlette.

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:49.980
With my mother...?

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:55.600
Yes. Arlette was here. I was the one
who protected her as she slept.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:58.480
My mother was here...?

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:01.900
It was 100 years ago...

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:06.520
You must be Pavel, the ice sorcerer.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.400
I'm Kyle, king of Orvelia.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.480
She is Lorraine.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.690
Nice to meet you, Mr. Pavel.

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:16.230
We're on a trip to hunt Demons.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:18.940
We heard rumors about you,
so we came to pay you a visit.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.730
I want you to join us.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.650
I decline.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:24.900
Why?

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.310
Go away.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:33.350
King Kyle?!

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:38.060
Oh, you're nicer than I thought.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.730
You weren't seriously trying to hit me.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:49.850
Just as powerful as rumored.
Now I really want you to join us!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:51.980
King Kyle!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.600
Please come with us.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.440
Get out.

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:07.310
Hmm.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:10.350
We'll be back.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:16.480
And as he said, King Kyle came again.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:18.440
I'm here, Pavel.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:21.020
Nothing has changed or would ever change.

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:23.230
Please just listen.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.980
We need your strength, Mr. Pavel.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.850
I already said no.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:32.980
There must be a good reason
why you so ardently refuse.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.400
Because you're all annoying.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.770
What...?

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:41.600
You, the Demons... I don't want
to deal with anyone else, ever.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:44.650
That's how I've been living.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:48.060
This world is starting to overflow with Demons.

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:51.850
If we don't stop them, the world might end.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:54.190
So?

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:58.560
Those with strength have the responsibility
to use it to save others!

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.060
That is what I believe!

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:04.020
What happens to others does not concern me.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:07.310
There's no point in talking to
someone like this.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.250
Let's leave.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.600
Lorraine?!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:13.690
I don't want to become friends with this person.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.190
Excuse me!

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.690
Hey...!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:33.020
I thought that was the end of it,
that they would never come back. But...

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:37.150
Hey, Pavel.

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:38.310
Leave.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.150
I can't.

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.650
Why?

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:43.250
To protect everyone.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.520
Everyone?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.770
Yeah. The people of Orvelia, obviously,

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:52.480
but also the Elves, Dark Elves, Orcs,
and everyone else living on this world.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.810
I don't understand.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:58.060
Once you find something precious
that you want to protect, you will.

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:05.600
I was starting to grow tired
of making King Kyle leave.

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:14.770
Soon, I actually started
to enjoy talking to King Kyle.

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:31.270
So you feel like joining us now?

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.730
Yes. That seems to be the only way
to make you shut up about it.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:38.650
I'll defeat the Demons so that
I can go back to a peaceful life.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:42.810
Whatever the reason might be,
thank you for your help, Mr. Pavel.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.810
Just Pavel is fine.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.350
And that's how I took off
on the journey with King Kyle.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:54.770
Later, King Kyle received the Holy Sword Aea
from Lua, the Goddess of Light.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:10:00.150
The goal of our journey changed
to defeating the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.230
Then, one day...

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.980
Pavel, I'm coming in.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:11.900
Say it before you come in...

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.670
How many times do I
have to tell you not to barge in...

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.940
Oh, sorry.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:19.150
It's fine. I've gotten used to it.

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:21.100
Thanks, Pavel.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:27.480
The Demon hunt is going smoothly thanks to you.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:31.060
I really believe I have the strongest ally.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:34.230
Based on that trust, I have a request for you.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:37.650
If something happens to me,
please take care of Arlette,

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.190
and the child she is carrying.

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:42.100
What's this, all of a sudden?

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:45.940
Just make sure that "something" never happens.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:50.440
Or... Are you planning to die?

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.100
Of course not!

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:58.020
I'll never give up, which includes
my own life as well as this world.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:03.190
That was the last conversation
I had with King Kyle.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:07.730
He then fought the Dark Lord
and vanished with him.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.730
Leaving the Holy Sword Aea behind...

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.690
So where did King Kyle go...?

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.980
I don't know.

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:20.440
We were concerned about where King Kyle went,

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:24.350
but we first had to do something important.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:26.650
Sealing away the Holy Sword Aea.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:35.190
The Holy Sword Aea is the only sword
that can defeat the Dark Lord.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:39.940
But with its user gone, there was
a high chance the Demons would go after it.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:42.650
So that's why you sealed it away.

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:44.400
Yes.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:50.520
After sealing the Holy Sword,
my companions all went back to their homes.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.980
A few days after that...

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:56.770
I oppose!

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.440
I oppose!

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:05.270
Are you serious, Dominix?

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:06.980
Of course.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:10.600
We're not even sure King Kyle is truly dead!

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:16.730
It's quite likely that he fell in the chasm
between dimensions with the Dark Lord.

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:24.100
He may have sacrificed himself to push
the Dark Lord Angmund back to the other side.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:30.850
But still! Does that justify
sacrificing two more people?!

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.940
There is no other way.

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:38.810
Please don't misunderstand.
I don't like this idea either.

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:44.190
However, there is a chance that
the Dark Lord would return in 100 years.

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:48.230
There is nothing else we can do
to save this world.

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:49.850
That's absurd!

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:52.690
Pavel! What do you think?

00:12:53.810 --> 00:13:00.400
I feel... if there is no other way,
perhaps we must do this.

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:02.190
You, too...?

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:05.690
I've already spoken to Aeatola and the others.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.900
They all support the idea.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:13.520
I can't decide. What would she say...?

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:19.850
Then let's go ask her.
Not that it would change anything.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:24.100
Kyle...

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.980
...disappeared...?

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:27.730
Yes.

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:29.190
But...

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:35.520
Everyone is doing everything
in their power to find King Kyle.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:39.560
Let's talk about realistic options.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:43.230
There is a high probability
that King Kyle would not return.

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:45.900
Dominix!

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:52.440
Not just King Kyle.
Maria, who was with him, is also missing.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:54.190
Miss Maria, too...

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:57.060
And so is the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:14:01.310
Nobody saw King Kyle's battle.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:07.980
Arlette, given this situation,
I come to you with a request.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:09.850
To me...?

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:17.020
The plan that Dominix put together
was to put her and her unborn child to sleep

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:21.100
to prepare for the day the Dark Lord returns,
one hundred years later.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:26.850
This child is the heir to the Holy Sword...?

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:30.480
We don't know for certain.
It's just a possibility.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:33.440
Yes, exactly. But...

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:38.730
King Kyle was the only one
who could use the Holy Sword Aea.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:44.690
King Kyle's child might be able
to inherit the Holy Sword.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:48.730
If I decline, what will happen?

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:52.690
If another heir to the Holy Sword appears,
then all is well.

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:57.730
But if not, the next time, the Dark Lord
may succeed in destroying the world.

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:04.190
I understand.

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:06.480
I will participate in your idea.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:07.520
Wait...

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:10.940
Arlette, you have your own life to live.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.980
Yours and your child's life as well!

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:14.730
Yes.

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:18.770
If you accept Dominix's idea,
when you wake up,

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:22.480
the world would be completely different!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.770
Master Lorraine, thank you for your concern.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:30.190
However, I think that,
if I don't accept this idea,

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:33.730
the people in the future would suffer.

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:37.520
That's not a world that Kyle would want either.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:42.190
But I want you to promise one thing.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:45.310
I will do anything within my power.

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:50.900
When I wake up, I want to see you all again.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:56.940
Then, I want you all to help my child,
like you helped Kyle.

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:58.770
Arlette...

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:02.190
I understand. I promise.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.270
We will protect you both.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.560
Thank you, Master Pavel.

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:14.690
King Kyle has requested me
to take care of you and your child.

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:17.400
Kyle did...?

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:21.100
Please begin.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.230
My mother was here...?

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:32.560
Yes. It was only a short time for me,

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:37.060
but the world has changed
quite a bit in the last 100 years.

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.060
People have gone to war with each other,

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:42.520
and contact with the Orcs and Elves were lost.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:48.150
Where was the peace that King Kyle
risked his life to protect?

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.480
I asked myself that every day.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:56.100
Sacrifice two people for the sake of the world.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:17:00.520
Was our choice truly the right one?

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.850
No matter how much I thought,
I could not come up with an answer.

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:09.310
And today... I still don't have an answer.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.560
I don't know either.

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:16.600
I see.

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:21.150
But I don't feel like I was
forced to sacrifice myself.

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:23.400
I chose to do this out of my own free will.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:27.310
That's why I'm here with my friends.

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:32.270
Frey has been with me since we were very small,
and now she's travelling with me.

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:36.770
Cleo and Roi are valuable companions, too.

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:39.480
I also think...

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:45.560
Yes, conflict is everywhere,
and some people hate each other.

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:48.940
But that's not all.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:52.730
There might be misunderstandings
in the beginning...

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.770
...but it's possible to come
to an understanding!

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:02.350
The peace that King Kyle wanted
to protect hasn't vanished yet.

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:08.440
I'll never give up on everyone, on this world!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:17.520
Your son is just like you.

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:20.270
Kasel.

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:25.940
You seem to have inherited the strong will
of both King Kyle and Arlette.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.650
Master Pavel...

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:32.560
However, it is no longer possible
to stop the Dark Lord's return.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:36.650
The nocturnal sun overlaps the moon tonight.

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:37.900
No...

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:39.810
What should we do?!

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.650
We should get the Holy Sword!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.850
If we can't stop him from returning,
we can defeat him!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:51.900
That's right!

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.270
Yes!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.980
Yeah.

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.650
I'll unseal the Holy Sword. Let's go.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.850
Huh? Go where?

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:03.400
The World Tree.
That's where the Holy Sword is sealed.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:09.020
The World Tree?
The most holy place in the world?

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:10.690
Yes.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:14.520
I was taught that it is a holy place
protected by Lua's power,

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:19.020
and that no one is allowed to go near.

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:22.190
I see. You don't know.

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:27.900
The World Tree is one of the pillars
supporting the world.

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:31.730
If it is destroyed, the world would collapse.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:37.100
That's why a holy power protects
the World Tree and the surrounding area.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:41.190
I never imagined that the World Tree
had such a secret...

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:44.060
Normal Demons would not even
be able to get close.

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:46.400
But the Dark Lord might...

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:51.900
If the Holy Sword fell into the hands
of the Dark Lord, there would be trouble.

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:52.980
Let's hurry.

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:54.310
Yes.

00:19:58.190 --> 00:19:59.850
What's wrong, Frey?

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.190
No, it's nothing.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:46.350
<i>This one wish</i>

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:49.060
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.850
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.900
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:12.440
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:18.310
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:22.940
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:29.650
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:35.100
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.400
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.770
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:43.440
<i>This one wish</i>

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:46.310
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:49.060
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:51.850
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:54.650
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:57.400
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:00.230
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:03.190
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:19.730
The time has finally come.

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:23.350
The moment that I've been waiting for,
for one hundred years!

00:22:23.350 --> 00:22:28.230
The time for the Dark Lord Angmund
to lay waste to this world...!

00:22:31.230 --> 00:22:34.150
Now, let us begin!

00:23:46.810 --> 00:23:49.770
One hundred years ago,
Illya was declared a sinner

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:54.270
for creating the False Sword
to replace the Holy Sword Aea.

00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:59.400
Her true story is revealed in the diary
she left in the Tower of the Sage.

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>Illya's            Truth
